# Idle Kingdoms agent workflow

Read and follow `docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md` and `AGENTS.md` before writing code.

- Owner sends instructions → share a plan → stop until they confirm.
- Implement confirmed work on `test-launch` only (https://test.restoriaidle.com).
- Do not create standalone feature branches.
- Do not commit to or merge into `main` until the owner playtests the test site and explicitly says to ship (https://restoriaidle.com).
- Migrations still owed to live are listed under "Pending on live" in `docs/deployment.md`.
